        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move costs 1 stamina; when stamina reaches 0 you lose 1 life and stamina resets to max, and losing all lives ends the game. Movement is constrained by walls, communicated each turn via blocked_directions, and attempting a blocked direction wastes the turn (no movement) but still costs stamina. Stepping on modifier tiles changes the carried piece: shape changers cycle shapes 0\u20135, color changers cycle colors in order orange\u2192blue\u2192green\u2192red\u2192orange, and rotation changers rotate 90\u00b0 clockwise through 0\u00b0\u219290\u00b0\u2192180\u00b0\u2192270\u00b0\u21920\u00b0. A goal activates only when shape, color, and rotation all match simultaneously; stepping onto an activated goal completes it. Stamina refill tiles restore stamina when stepped on."
